  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4c8f78b6240adb00f22fdab",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在！樱花千代王就在这里哦！\n随时听候您的指示。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9eca5b6ebe71081bbbed2da515a0949fe4ec686f9112c7ae6921cc066291462",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32edf3b331a653e4ca4e8314",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不断努力，\n静候樱花满开的那一天——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a062725b5a599105264483732b0bee1e80cab09a2bb91cff7e0d2082c6b0e43e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:016d48e16be0bf62c8d92932",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正所谓『只要努力磨的话白萝卜也能变成泥』\n只要继续努力，我也一定――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3af0cbf7a17ed3b22619d6327a8241823064f7ad98b063d3913ebc8d3772fb13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b320c21667fd4b9729899b7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要开始训练的话，\n就肯定没问题了……吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "faf8ad9386f5d4dced5b489b1cfca92fbe69d2796fdb4147a20151188a5047aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14a80a88c710c94475ea102e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是不绞尽全力的话，\n我根本追不上其他人的步伐……\n虽然我知道这个道理，但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d956f385850c9c3a9057b7069f7063a9d58a45d475da9e28139ebcd75bb5c614",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83de726b98d314a99a43e5ea",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我马上就能打起精神，\n所以请稍等片刻……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b44dab907233396ea40d17cb52f4bfa802eb697610dcfe0d932b695da73af2f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9b9c7c75a03a7455277a46f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还要继续跑比赛吗……\n虽说我也不是不想跑……不过……\n现在也许别太勉强比较好……吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "78c4f245568a24452bb7532cfd3d8ea10be85cdcd07b14c6457209fc9f45ff2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4df13f2cb240a0ed227b7d1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是在这里燃尽的话，\n本来能达成的目标也会离我远去的……\n……可以请您重新考虑一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87fb31624f7ee12153a66b91ee47dae0b2e1b73a9dab67c2b5045eca23f5e02a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20022"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20022"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca55728f23c735d0bdd10721",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如今正是樱花满开之时――！\n感觉浑身的血都燃烧起来了呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3c1e4ccab9e1a3f47adb6d099e04ffcc25c701e6afeba723c891fc7499c7948",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20023"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20023"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4370cd083d62a87c96fa4957",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "力量涌上来了呢！\n堂堂正正——\n一决胜负吧～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcd012cc5a09062c5997992c80a5404582b35a9f3bfd61df12b6e7bf46efbd3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20024"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20024"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:734e68eea3fd6f5e21bd8b14",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『只要沉下心来用千代般的耳朵倾听，\n鼓号曲便萦绕在耳畔』――\n就是说，胜利已经近在眼前！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f325cf886429bdc098f72c276912df10cf8fe9d8553aa20869b6885a088a8b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20025"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20025"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fec6f19af8deaa3e26de5eb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请您安心地拭目以待吧♪\n为了能在比赛中尽情绽放，\n我们都已经付出那么多努力了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71b89dc1ca92841fd637bf45d6703b4c3255356d6f0a53f7bc662226bc5bffbd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20026"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20026"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f4b16298809efc0f523c0e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我成不了『超级跑车』，\n但要做到轻型轿车的程度还是没问题的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4483843219c9e752c831c8ed8dcd2bf752d647014a3c35facaabdd1d07e8a43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20027"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20027"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9197ed62754e4096f9961e4c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是我奔跑的身姿，\n也能残留在谁的心里就好了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9800dd32b86eab25ce2607de83362c1e30aa32b33fd370f6b520cad527365277",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20028"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20028"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97970a7ef78740925692bbf6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要正常发挥的话就没问题哦！\n毕竟我们也跑了这么多比赛了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3b63dbc448895aa92cfbc49c16fb032c30d17907520a30bb2c4caa49a97aa57",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20029"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20029"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:025b9b4a359599bda4b9fd55",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "马上就要开闸了…！\n稍微有点紧张呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff8ae1b55ee0ce1bdbf3121734f77ee82d2390b75a8f0d710a4ba2bf2f03b614",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20030"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20030"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:032b152cac281f748a32ba2b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊！在比赛开始之前，\n得先翻翻看千代笔记呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e93213ca7b84b0a3a8d055eb012a165dca0f89bf760261c0de29dbe26612a123",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20031"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20031"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2584fe3e106d4c09a2c908a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然还有些不安……\n但要是不迈步前行的话，就只能原地踏步了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3739673341c7d0b269cb220b99a363ccfc8c10a087056bddb31b9c2f5509efbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20032"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20032"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aa02c8dfb7f85cc31f45781",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个……能请您在观众席为我加油吗？\n这样的话，就一定――",
      "source_fingerprint": "497a4a57c603c8e1aee937a86defc77e21b97485a21bb32462238985600240f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20033"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20033"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7d54ee8723481764ee7fdba",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我能做到的事情……\n就只有拼尽全力地奔跑而已。\n现在必须这么想……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b643a0d8f5f49d78a81131fe2c75fbea64b3a14a7421b83100ecdb7ba57c127",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "20034"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1069/20034"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d960b60b03d6fba179f916",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千代笔记第88页……\n『只要忍耐的话，就算是3浪也不过等于1浪』……\n只要坚持下去的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c1337307fa1de4b602e78929f6be5d9cc102a11e46d28a21997133a41d85f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
